### CHAP HTTP API Test Endpoints
### TypeScript backend: http://localhost:8083
### Docker Compose backend: http://localhost:8081

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8083
@email = ts-user@example.com
@password = testpassword123
@jwt = REPLACE_WITH_JWT
@targetUserId = REPLACE_WITH_TARGET_USER_ID

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Sign Up
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "name": "TypeScript User"
}

### Sign In
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Get Me
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Follow User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{targetUserId}}/follow
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Unfollow User
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{targetUserId}}/follow
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Upload Image URL
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/images/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filename": "sample.png"
}
